{"code":"N11","wikidata":"Q76972519","wikipedia":{"en":"Ratchayothin BTS station","th":"สถานีรัชโยธิน"},"summary":{"en":"Ratchayothin Station is a BTS Skytrain station, on the Sukhumvit line in Bangkok, Thailand. The station was planned to open in 2020 when all stations on the northern extension was completed, but the Ministry of Transport requested the station to open in phase 2 (Ha Yaek Lat Phrao-Kasetsart University) in December 2019.","th":"สถานีรัชโยธิน เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้าบีทีเอสแบบยกระดับในเส้นทางสายสุขุมวิท ยกระดับเหนือถนนพหลโยธินในพื้นที่เขตจตุจักร กรุงเทพมหานคร มีกำหนดเปิดให้บริการในวันที่ 4 ธันวาคม พ.ศ."},"opened":"2019-12-04","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b6/BTS_Ratchayothin_-_Station.jpg/960px-BTS_Ratchayothin_-_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:BTS_Ratchayothin_-_Station.jpg","author":"Rachasak Ragkamnerd","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9e/BTS_N11_Ratchayothin_Station.jpg/960px-BTS_N11_Ratchayothin_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:BTS_N11_Ratchayothin_Station.jpg","author":"Wasin147","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c1/BTS_Ratchayothin_-_Exit_stairway_-_Inbound_side.jpg/960px-BTS_Ratchayothin_-_Exit_stairway_-_Inbound_side.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:BTS_Ratchayothin_-_Exit_stairway_-_Inbound_side.jpg","author":"Rachasak Ragkamnerd","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/BTS_Ratchayothin_-_Info_board_near_the_exit_stairway.jpg/960px-BTS_Ratchayothin_-_Info_board_near_the_exit_stairway.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imag